伸至画面下方，形成视觉引导。沙发与窗帘形成纵深感，背景中隐约可见建筑外景，强化空间层次。光影以自然光为主，辅以壁灯暖光，明暗过渡柔和，突出人物轮廓与服装质感。整体氛围兼具法式优雅与现代简约，既有艺术摄影的精致感，也保留日常拍摄的自然真实感，画面干净、色调和谐，细节丰富却不喧宾夺主，呈现出一种宁静、高雅的生活美学。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 31, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [294.28955078125, 217.921142578125], "pos": [744.1878662109375, 464.60223388671875], "id": 13, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "anything", "links": [37], "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [true, true], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 36, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}, {"widget": {"name": "purge_cache"}, "name": "purge_cache", "label": "purge_cache", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "purge_cache"}, {"widget": {"name": "purge_models"}, "name": "purge_models", "label": "purge_models", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "purge_models"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "PurgeVRAM_UTK", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [270, 82], "pos": [1679.0938720703125, 187.37911987304688], "id": 32, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PurgeVRAM_UTK", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#353", "groupcolor": "#8A8", "color": "#232"}}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "links": [2], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["qwen_3_4b.safetensors", "qwen_image", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "CLIP名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "类型"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "设备"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPLoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353"